### Development

```text
Browser → https://<dev-host>
  → Edge proxy (self-signed TLS, Docker provider)
      ├─ priority 100 → backend container (:80)    [paths…]
      └─ priority 10  → app proxy → host:3000      catch-all
```

- **App**: [Next.js dev server on host :3000]
- **Backend**: [container name, port]
- **Database**: [container, port, volume]
- **Edge**: [proxy, version, ports, network]
- **Hosts entry**: [loopback mapping]

### Production

```text
Internet → CDN/WAF → Edge proxy (:80/:443, resolver: <name>)
  ├─ priority 110, no bot protection → callbacks   [paths…]
  ├─ priority 100 → backend (:80)                  [paths…]
  └─ priority  10 → app (:3000)                    catch-all
```

- **Registry / image names**: [e.g. `ghcr.io/<owner>/app`, `…/backend`]
- **Platforms**: [e.g. `linux/amd64`, `linux/arm64`]
- **Persistence**: [bind mounts under `prod/data/`; no named volumes]
