## 3. Auth & Session Contract

```text
Browser ──Cookie: <prefix>_<hash>──► App server
                                        │ whitelist → cookie header
                                        ▼
                              Backend session validation
                                        │
                        principal === null ? guest : signed in
```

| Concern | Owner | Detail |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Credentials, registration, reset | [backend] | [native account form] |
| Session cookie | [backend] | [prefix], HttpOnly, host-only |
| Login state | [backend] | positive principal id only |
| Account/order reads | app | forwards whitelisted cookies |
| Logout | [backend] | server-minted logout URL/nonce |

**Invariants**
- **One hostname.** [explain the split failure]
- **Cookie names are hashed.** Match by prefix only.
- **Presence ≠ authentication.** Require a positive principal id.
- **One session store.** The app never mints a second session.
- **Failure mode:** [guest card / redirect / 401] and why it is not fail-open.

