## 5. Integrations & Pinning

| Integration | Version | Source | Integrity | Activation order |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: |
| [package/plugin] | [x.y.z] | [registry/tag] | [sha256] | 1 |
| [package/plugin] | [x.y.z] | [registry/tag] | [sha256] | 2 |

- Every dependency is pinned; `latest` is a defect.
- Record upstream hashes where available and verify at build/install.
- Activation order matters when add-ons hook each other — test on a clean install.
- Updates are reviewed re-pins, never runtime downloads.

